=E2=80=9D</h3>
<p><strong>Given (Bi=E1=BA=BFt r=E1=BA=B1ng):</strong><br>
  Phi=E1=BA=BFu ti=E1=BA=BFp nh=E1=BA=ADn nguy=C3=AAn li=E1=BB=87u kh=C3=A1=
ch =C4=91=C3=A3 ph=C3=A1t sinh ch=C3=AAnh l=E1=BB=87ch bao b=C3=AC v=C6=B0=
=E1=BB=A3t m=E1=BB=A9c v=C3=A0 =C4=91=C3=A3 =C4=91=C6=B0=E1=BB=A3c ng=C6=B0=
